; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2369  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2370    \ID COV_PDUR_ONLY_TP_QUEUED_ROUTINGS
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2371      \ACCEPT TX
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2372      \REASON The condition is always true if there are only queued transport protocol routings and no unqueued routings in the configuration.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2373  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2374    \ID COV_PDUR_ONLY_DEFERRED_TP_QUEUED_ROUTINGS
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2375      \ACCEPT XF
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2376      \REASON The condition is always false as the transmission to the destination is always successful for deferred routings. It can only fail in the MainFunction context.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2377  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2378    \ID COV_PDUR_NO_DEFERRED_IF_ROUTING
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2379      \ACCEPT X
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2380      \REASON Function is never covered in configurations without deferred If routing paths. The function is always referenced by a function pointer.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2381  
