; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2383      \ACCEPT X
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2384      \REASON Function is never covered in configurations without deferred Tp routing paths. The function is always referenced by a function pointer.
