; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2437      \REASON  If the provided length is greater than the maximum buffer size the value is truncated to this value. Therefore the code code not be reached in case of communication interface routing.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\PduR\PduR.c	  2438  
